    <div class="blog_title">
        <h4>
            <a href="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/questions-parents-ask-about-apexogenesis-and-apexification/">Top 5 Questions Parents Ask About Apexogenesis and Apexification for Kids’ Tooth Injuries</a>
        </h4>
    </div>
    <div class="blog_author">
        By Synergy Endodontics 
    </div>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></article> </main>
    

  <footer class="x-colophon" role="contentinfo">

    
    <div class="cs-content x-global-block x-global-block-459 e440-e1"><div class="x-section e459-e2 mcr-0 rev-sec-bg"><div class="x-row x-container max width e459-e3 mcr-1 mcr-2"><div class="x-row-inner"><div class="x-col e459-e4 mcr-3"><div class="x-text x-text-headline e459-e5 mcr-4 mcr-5 rev-sec-bg"><div class="x-text-content"><div class="x-text-content-text"><h2 class="x-text-content-text-primary">Words from Our Satisfied Clients</h2>
</div></div></div><div class="x-div x-hide-lg x-hide-md x-hide-sm x-hide-xl x-hide-xs e459-e6 mcr-7 mcr-8 mcr-9"><div class="embedsocial-hashtag" data-ref="e78a9c7f699167f7ae0edc7b976fe6065afdb6ee"></div> <script type="text/rocketlazyloadscript"> (function(d, s, id) { var js; if (d.getElementById(id)) {return;} js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id; js.src = "https://embedsocial.com/cdn/ht.js"; d.getElementsByTagName("head")[0].appendChild(js); }(document, "script", "EmbedSocialHashtagScript")); </script></div><div class="x-div x-container max width e459-e8 mcr-7 mcr-a"><div class="x-div e459-e9 mcr-7 mcr-a"><div class="x-slide-container-viewport is-loading e459-e10 mcr-d draggble-false" data-x-slide-container="{&quot;keyboardNavigation&quot;:true,&quot;autoplayStartInView&quot;:true,&quot;snap&quot;:true,&quot;wrapAround&quot;:true,&quot;int&quot;:&quot;drag off&quot;,&quot;direction&quot;:&quot;forward&quot;,&quot;startingSlide&quot;:1,&quot;autoplay&quot;:&quot;interval&quot;}"><div class="x-slide-container-content"><div class="x-slide-container is-inline is-paged"><div class="x-slide e459-e11 mcr-e" data-x-slide=""><div class="x-text x-content e459-e12 mcr-f">I had excellent care and treatment at Synergy Endodontics, Palmdale today.  The outcome for my tooth wasn't the best news, but Dr. Oo tried everything and viewed every angle to find a way around an extraction.  I appreciated all their efforts and highly recommend if you have a need for endodontics, reach out to this office!</div><div class="x-text x-text-headline e459-e13 mcr-5 mcr-6"><div class="x-text-content"><div class="x-text-content-text"><h3 class="x-text-content-text-primary">- Yolanda R.</h3>
</div></div></div><span class="x-image e459-e14 mcr-g"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20129%2024'%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services." data-lazy-src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png"><noscript><img src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services."></noscript></span></div><div class="x-slide e459-e15 mcr-e" data-x-slide=""><div class="x-text x-content e459-e16 mcr-f">I went for to see Dr. Li for a tooth that had had a previous root canal and now was very infected and I was in pain. After preliminary X-rays and CT, his staff scheduled me for a root canal the next day. Dr. Li explained everything about this complicated case and felt the tooth  could be saved. He is very professional, skilled, caring and has a great bedside manner. He’s just done a second root canal that was painless and I actually started to fall asleep. Very impressed with the entire staff. Highly recommend.</div><div class="x-text x-text-headline e459-e17 mcr-5 mcr-6"><div class="x-text-content"><div class="x-text-content-text"><h3 class="x-text-content-text-primary">- Beth G.</h3>
</div></div></div><span class="x-image e459-e18 mcr-g"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20129%2024'%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services." data-lazy-src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png"><noscript><img src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services."></noscript></span></div><div class="x-slide e459-e19 mcr-e" data-x-slide=""><div class="x-text x-content e459-e20 mcr-f">Very pleased. Office staff presented me with the exact charge for the procedure then informed me of my share no surprises.  Then Dr. Monseff explained what he saw and how we can proceed. He answered my questions and I appreciated his patience and professionalism and his telling me what I can expect at my next visit. Talk about putting me at ease! Thank you staff and Doctor!</div><div class="x-text x-text-headline e459-e21 mcr-5 mcr-6"><div class="x-text-content"><div class="x-text-content-text"><h3 class="x-text-content-text-primary">- M & W</h3>
</div></div></div><span class="x-image e459-e22 mcr-g"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20129%2024'%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services." data-lazy-src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png"><noscript><img src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services."></noscript></span></div><div class="x-slide e459-e23 mcr-e" data-x-slide=""><div class="x-text x-content e459-e24 mcr-f">Dr. Oo and her staff were wonderful and very gentle with my husband who suffers with extreme dental anxiety. He walked out of the building with a smile on his face and zero pain after two root canals. Cannot recommend Synergy Endodontics enough!</div><div class="x-text x-text-headline e459-e25 mcr-5 mcr-6"><div class="x-text-content"><div class="x-text-content-text"><h3 class="x-text-content-text-primary">- Blanca W.</h3>
</div></div></div><span class="x-image e459-e26 mcr-g"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20129%2024'%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services." data-lazy-src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png"><noscript><img src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services."></noscript></span></div><div class="x-slide e459-e27 mcr-e" data-x-slide=""><div class="x-text x-content e459-e28 mcr-f">I had the good fortune to be treated by Dr. Monsef. I was very fearful about the root canal, but he put me at ease by explaining what he was doing as he moved along and the procedure was painless. Several days later I went to a family dentist for the crown prep, and had some issues with pain and called Dr. Monsef with concerns. The good doctor took the time to look at the pain site and explain what had occurred. I am so appreciative of his time and professionalism.</div><div class="x-text x-text-headline e459-e29 mcr-5 mcr-6"><div class="x-text-content"><div class="x-text-content-text"><h3 class="x-text-content-text-primary">- Kathy W.</h3>
</div></div></div><span class="x-image e459-e30 mcr-g"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20129%2024'%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services." data-lazy-src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png"><noscript><img src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services."></noscript></span></div><div class="x-slide e459-e31 mcr-e" data-x-slide=""><div class="x-text x-content e459-e32 mcr-f">I immediately felt comfortable there, the docs bedside manner was excellent and everyone was welcoming, friendly and very accommodating.  Dentist offices tend to be a place that invokes great anxiety and I felt at ease the entire time.  He took his time explaining the process and offering options in terms of what procedures/the next steps I could take would be… all around great experience.</div><div class="x-text x-text-headline e459-e33 mcr-5 mcr-6"><div class="x-text-content"><div class="x-text-content-text"><h3 class="x-text-content-text-primary">- Tarsia H.</h3>
</div></div></div><span class="x-image e459-e34 mcr-g"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20129%2024'%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services." data-lazy-src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png"><noscript><img src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services."></noscript></span></div><div class="x-slide e459-e35 mcr-e" data-x-slide=""><div class="x-text x-content e459-e36 mcr-f">I was referred to Dr. Li by my new dentist. He is very thorough, extremely knowledgeable and has a great “chair-side” manner. The office staff all seem very efficient and welcoming. My X-ray was performed by a really great dental technician whose name I did not get, unfortunately. She was very gentle, professional and quick. I had a great first visit to Synergy Endodontics.</div><div class="x-text x-text-headline e459-e37 mcr-5 mcr-6"><div class="x-text-content"><div class="x-text-content-text"><h3 class="x-text-content-text-primary">- Tanya H.</h3>
</div></div></div><span class="x-image e459-e38 mcr-g"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20129%2024'%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services." data-lazy-src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png"><noscript><img src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services."></noscript></span></div><div class="x-slide e459-e39 mcr-e" data-x-slide=""><div class="x-text x-content e459-e40 mcr-f">Dr Monsef is a magic man. I went in for a root canal on a tooth that was pretty far gone. I literally felt NOTHING. From the initial local anesthetic, through the whole procedure, to now the next day, Nothing. He said I might have some gum irritation the next day, I’m sitting here like nothing happened. THANK YOU DR MONSEF.</div><div class="x-text x-text-headline e459-e41 mcr-5 mcr-6"><div class="x-text-content"><div class="x-text-content-text"><h3 class="x-text-content-text-primary">- Jonathan R.</h3>
</div></div></div><span class="x-image e459-e42 mcr-g"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20129%2024'%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services." data-lazy-src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png"><noscript><img src="https://www.synergyendodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/img-5star.png" width="129" height="24" alt="Five gold stars representing an excellent customer rating for dental services."></noscript></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="x-div e459-e43 mcr-7 mcr-a mcr-b"><ul class="x-slide-pagination is-row e459-e44 mcr-h rev-sec-bg" data-x-slide-pagination=""></ul></div></div><div class="x-div x-hide-xs e459-e45 mcr-7 mcr-8 mcr-a mcr-c vid-bo"></div></div></div></div></div></div><style> .mcr-0.x-section{margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;border-top-width:0;border-right-width:0;border-bottom-width:0;border-left-width:0;padding-top:60px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:60px;padding-left:0px;background-color:#F4FCFE;z-index:auto;}.mcr-1.x-row{z-index:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto;border-top-width:0;border-right-width:0;border-bottom-width:0;border-left-width:0;padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-bottom:1px;padding-left:1px;font-size:1em;}.mcr-1 > .x-row-inner{flex-direction:row;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:stretch;align-content:stretch;margin-top:calc(((20px / 2) + 1px) * -1);margin-right:calc(((20px / 2) + 1px) * -1);margin-bottom:calc(((20px / 2) + 1px) * -1);margin-left:calc(((20px / 2) + 1px) * -1);}.mcr-1 > .x-row-inner > *{margin-top:calc(20px / 2);margin-bottom:calc(20px / 2);margin-right:calc(20px / 2);margin-left:calc(20px / 2);}.mcr-2{--gap:20px;}.mcr-2 > .x-row-inner > *:nth-child(1n - 0) {flex-basis:calc(100% - clamp(0px,var(--gap),9999px));}.mcr-3.x-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:cen